        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% CLIENTS\n%% ==========================\n\nA[\&quot;Client Applications&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Next.js Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;Mobile Apps&lt;br/&gt;External Clients\&quot;]\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% API ENTRY\n%% ==========================\n\nB[\&quot;API Gateway / FastAPI Entry Point&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;HTTP Requests&lt;br/&gt;Routing&lt;br/&gt;Middleware\&quot;]\n\n\nC[\&quot;Authentication Layer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;JWT Validation&lt;br/&gt;User Identity&lt;br/&gt;Tenant Context\&quot;]\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% API LAYER\n%% ==========================\n\nD[\&quot;API Router Layer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;FastAPI Routers&lt;br/&gt;Request Validation&lt;br/&gt;Response Models\&quot;]\n\n\nE[\&quot;WebSocket / Event Handlers&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Realtime updates&lt;br/&gt;Voice events&lt;br/&gt;Agent status\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% SERVICE LAYER\n%% ==========================\n\nF[\&quot;User Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Users&lt;br/&gt;Roles&lt;br/&gt;Permissions\&quot;]\n\n\nG[\&quot;Tenant Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Organizations&lt;br/&gt;Isolation&lt;br/&gt;Subscriptions\&quot;]\n\n\nH[\&quot;Agent Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Create agents&lt;br/&gt;Configure agents&lt;br/&gt;Deploy agents\&quot;]\n\n\nI[\&quot;Knowledge Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Upload documents&lt;br/&gt;Manage RAG data\&quot;]\n\n\nJ[\&quot;Conversation Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Calls&lt;br/&gt;Messages&lt;br/&gt;Analytics\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% AI SERVICES\n%% ==========================\n\nK[\&quot;LiveKit Integration Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Rooms&lt;br/&gt;Dispatch&lt;br/&gt;Agent lifecycle\&quot;]\n\n\nL[\&quot;RAG Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Retrieval&lt;br/&gt;Embeddings&lt;br/&gt;Context building\&quot;]\n\n\nM[\&quot;Tool Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Async function tools&lt;br/&g